00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:09,038
Your drawings. Your tools. Meet Open PDF Studio. Free and open source.

2
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:17,554
Bring your technical drawings into one workspace. Explore the details, and keep your project in view.

3
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:27,638
